## Resync upstream

```bash
git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/addyosmani/agent-skills.git /tmp/agent-skills
rsync -a --exclude 'prisma-*' /tmp/agent-skills/skills/ .cursor/skills/
rm -rf /tmp/agent-skills
.cursor/scripts/enable-core-skill-auto-invoke.sh
```
